  "transcript": {
    "origin": "platform_srt",
    "cues": [
      {"id":"CUE-001","start":0,"end":4.72,"text":"近日湖北襄阳十九岁大二学生突发脑梗，入院时左侧肢体基本上全瘫了，口齿不清","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-001.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-001","SHOT-002","SHOT-003","SHOT-004","SHOT-005"]},
      {"id":"CUE-002","start":4.72,"end":7.49,"text":"发现患者经常熬夜。通宵点外卖吃油腻的东西","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-002.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-005","SHOT-006","SHOT-007","SHOT-008","SHOT-009","SHOT-010"]},
      {"id":"CUE-003","start":7.49,"end":10.019,"text":"熬夜吃的油腻，这不就是我吗？","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-003.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-010"]},
      {"id":"CUE-004","start":10.019,"end":14.54,"text":"每天都在假装关心自己的健康，但问题是在网上根本不知道该相信谁","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-004.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-010"]},
      {"id":"CUE-005","start":14.55,"end":19.192,"text":"你是不是跟我一样，凌晨一点还在刷着手机，想认真查一个健康问题","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-005.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-010","SHOT-011"]},
      {"id":"CUE-006","start":19.192,"end":21.61,"text":"结果搜出来的答案一个比一个吓人","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-006.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-011"]},
      {"id":"CUE-007","start":21.62,"end":26.622,"text":"一个个还不一样，越看越焦虑，而我只是想知道白天靠咖啡顶着算不算透支","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-007.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-011","SHOT-012","SHOT-013"]},
      {"id":"CUE-008","start":26.622,"end":28.64,"text":"这种强度的运动算不算太狠","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-008.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-013","SHOT-014"]},
      {"id":"CUE-009","start":28.65,"end":31.958,"text":"最近啊总是觉得累，注意力不够集中，是不是该调整一下","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-009.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-014"]},
      {"id":"CUE-010","start":31.958,"end":37.038,"text":"但这些问题貌似又不值得专门跑一趟，就在最近我体会到了一种完全不同的方式","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-010.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-014","SHOT-015","SHOT-016"]},
      {"id":"CUE-011","start":37.038,"end":38.61,"text":"哒哒我的健康搭子","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-011.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-016"]},
      {"id":"CUE-012","start":38.62,"end":42.927,"text":"是蚂蚁集团推出的ai应用阿福，我跟他聊聊最近的身体的感受","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-012.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-016","SHOT-017","SHOT-018"]},
      {"id":"CUE-013","start":42.927,"end":44.57,"text":"他并没有急着给我下结论","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-013.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-018","SHOT-019","SHOT-020","SHOT-021","SHOT-022","SHOT-023"]},
      {"id":"CUE-014","start":44.58,"end":48.679,"text":"而是先顺着我的情况继续往下问，比如我跟他说最近的身体总是很累","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-014.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-023","SHOT-024","SHOT-025","SHOT-026"]},
      {"id":"CUE-015","start":48.679,"end":50.66,"text":"他会先问我身体的其他感受","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-015.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-026","SHOT-027"]},
      {"id":"CUE-016","start":50.67,"end":55.187,"text":"比如说睡眠时长，还有哪里觉得不舒服等等，也就说我白天全靠咖啡撑着","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-016.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-027","SHOT-028","SHOT-029","SHOT-030","SHOT-031","SHOT-032"]},
      {"id":"CUE-017","start":55.187,"end":58.78,"text":"他会追问一天大概喝多少杯，再告诉我不加量就行","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-017.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-032","SHOT-033","SHOT-034","SHOT-035","SHOT-036","SHOT-037","SHOT-038"]},
      {"id":"CUE-018","start":58.79,"end":63.303,"text":"女生嘛，都想做好身材管理，我跟她说完自己的体重啊，身高啊等信息","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-018.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-038","SHOT-039"]},
      {"id":"CUE-019","start":63.303,"end":68.56,"text":"她还会确认我平时的运动频率啊，饮食习惯啊什么的，再告诉我需要增加力量训练","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-019.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-039"]},
      {"id":"CUE-020","start":68.57,"end":73.73,"text":"饮食怎么搭配等等，这种体验跟平时去网站解锁信息完全不一样，大家都知道","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-020.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-039","SHOT-040"]},
      {"id":"CUE-021","start":73.74,"end":77.534,"text":"健康相关的咨询没有标准答案，把问题一步步的梳理清楚","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-021.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-040"]},
      {"id":"CUE-022","start":77.534,"end":82.26,"text":"还有一些以前想要坚持但又总是断掉的小目标，我们也可以用它来记录","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-022.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-040","SHOT-041"]},
      {"id":"CUE-023","start":82.27,"end":86.91,"text":"比如坚持十二点前睡觉，睡觉前五分钟放松冥想，你看他不会催你","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-023.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-041","SHOT-042"]},
      {"id":"CUE-024","start":86.91,"end":89.5,"text":"只是想让你意识到。你已经在慢慢的变好","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-024.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-042","SHOT-043"]},
      {"id":"CUE-025","start":89.5,"end":93.66,"text":"阿福之所以这么客气，是因为他一直在用很高的专业标准在做健康管理","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-025.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-043","SHOT-044","SHOT-045","SHOT-046","SHOT-047","SHOT-048","SHOT-049","SHOT-050","SHOT-051","SHOT-052","SHOT-053","SHOT-054","SHOT-055","SHOT-056"]},
      {"id":"CUE-026","start":93.66,"end":96.5,"text":"只是提供参考，绝不制造恐慌，一整个靠谱","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-026.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-056","SHOT-057"]},
      {"id":"CUE-027","start":96.51,"end":101.19,"text":"我们这一代的打工人真正缺的就是这样一个能够看见你，也能够真正回应你","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-027.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-057","SHOT-058"]},
      {"id":"CUE-028","start":101.19,"end":105.6,"text":"并且能够完全确保你隐私的健康，搭子，你最想问的一个健康的问题是什么？","representativeFrame":"frames/cues/cue-028.jpg","overlappingShots":["SHOT-058"]}
    ]
  },
